    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "AGUVIS uses a <strong>two-stage training pipeline</strong> to develop GUI interaction capabilities. The first stage focuses on <strong>grounding</strong>, where the model learns to map visual observations to actions. The second stage develops <strong>planning and reasoning</strong> abilities, enabling the model to handle complex, multi-step tasks. This is achieved through a novel <strong>VLM-based trajectory augmentation process</strong> that generates rich training examples with inner monologue components.",
