    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "AGUVIS achieves <strong>state-of-the-art performance</strong> across various benchmarks, including ScreenSpot, Multimodal-Mind2Web, and AndroidControl. The results demonstrate the effectiveness of the unified vision-based approach and the importance of inner monologue in enhancing planning and grounding capabilities. Notably, AGUVIS shows significant improvements in <strong>cross-platform generalization</strong>, allowing the model to operate effectively across different GUI environments.",
